  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4112001",
      "subQuestName": "Speak to Grace",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411200101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411200101": {
            "id": "411200101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "I pray that everyone remains safe...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200102"
            ]
          },
          "411200102": {
            "id": "411200102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Something on your mind?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200103"
            ]
          },
          "411200103": {
            "id": "411200103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "Oh, it's you, Traveler. I suppose you've seen the meteorites too, haven't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200104"
            ]
          },
          "411200104": {
            "id": "411200104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "Fortunately, none of them landed inside the city, but I'm worried for those who are still outside. It must be a huge mess at the moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200105"
            ]
          },
          "411200105": {
            "id": "411200105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "Traveler, could you please help us warn them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200106"
            ]
          },
          "411200106": {
            "id": "411200106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "If they're willing, please invite them to seek shelter within the city.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200108",
              "411200110"
            ]
          },
          "411200108": {
            "id": "411200108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "Many thanks, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200112"
            ]
          },
          "411200112": {
            "id": "411200112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "You can look for Lynn first. Perhaps she knows who is and isn't still lingering in the wilderness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200113"
            ]
          },
          "411200113": {
            "id": "411200113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "Do try to convince her to seek shelter in Mondstadt herself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200114"
            ]
          },
          "411200114": {
            "id": "411200114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "This... really isn't the time for \"surviving in the wilderness.\""
          },
          "411200110": {
            "id": "411200110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "Perhaps it was just good fortune. Whatever the case, the city of Mondstadt is the safer place to be for now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200111"
            ]
          },
          "411200111": {
            "id": "411200111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "At least, it's better than being outside the city... wouldn't you say?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112002",
      "subQuestName": "Speak to Lynn",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411200201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411200201": {
            "id": "411200201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "These conditions do make surviving in the wilderness quite challenging, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200202"
            ]
          },
          "411200202": {
            "id": "411200202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Please seek shelter inside Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200203"
            ]
          },
          "411200203": {
            "id": "411200203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "Seek shelter? Oh, don't worry about me. I'm always watching my surroundings. I'll be fine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200204"
            ]
          },
          "411200204": {
            "id": "411200204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "That said, why are you still out here? You should head back to Mondstadt — you might get hit by one of those meteorites.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200205"
            ]
          },
          "411200205": {
            "id": "411200205",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why, yes — on the topic of people still out here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200206"
            ]
          },
          "411200206": {
            "id": "411200206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "People still out here? There's a lot of them, actually — why do you ask?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200208",
              "411200212"
            ]
          },
          "411200208": {
            "id": "411200208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "Oh, so that's what it is... The Guild actually sent out commissions to that effect. I've notified quite a few people nearby myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200209"
            ]
          },
          "411200209": {
            "id": "411200209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "Those closer to the city have all gone inside to seek shelter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200210"
            ]
          },
          "411200210": {
            "id": "411200210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "But we've been unable to get very many adventurers on the case because we're short on help, so there's still quite a few people who have gone unnotified. If you're willing to help, that would be great.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200215"
            ]
          },
          "411200215": {
            "id": "411200215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "Give me a moment to remember who's still out here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200216"
            ]
          },
          "411200216": {
            "id": "411200216",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "Ah, that's right! I believe Patchi and Doolan are still at the Thousand Winds Temple. I've tried to warn them, but they insisted on continuing their research there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200217"
            ]
          },
          "411200217": {
            "id": "411200217",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "There's also Vind, who's remained at Stormbearer Point all this while. The Guild asked me to look for her a few times, but I was never able to find her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200218"
            ]
          },
          "411200218": {
            "id": "411200218",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "That's all the people who come to mind for now. I guess you can start with them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200219"
            ]
          },
          "411200219": {
            "id": "411200219",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "As for me, I'll give the area another sweep and notify anyone I can find once I'm done preparing some food and other necessities.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200220"
            ]
          },
          "411200220": {
            "id": "411200220",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "Let's just hope they haven't run off too far, or it'll be hard for them to return to the city even if we do find them."
          },
          "411200212": {
            "id": "411200212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "Grace? So you're here on her behest... Actually, the Guild's sent out commissions to that effect, and I've notified quite a few people nearby myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200213"
            ]
          },
          "411200213": {
            "id": "411200213",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "Those closer to the city have all gone inside to seek shelter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200214"
            ]
          },
          "411200214": {
            "id": "411200214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Lynn",
            "text": "But we've been unable to get very many adventurers on the case because we're short on help, so there's still quite a few people who have gone unnotified. If you're willing to help, that would be great."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112003",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Doolan",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411200301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411200301": {
            "id": "411200301",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "This is no time for research, we should find a place to take cover!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200302"
            ]
          },
          "411200302": {
            "id": "411200302",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Patchi the Curious",
            "text": "I've said it before, and I'll say it again. I'm not letting this opportunity slip by.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200303"
            ]
          },
          "411200303": {
            "id": "411200303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Excuse me, please seek shelter within Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200304"
            ]
          },
          "411200304": {
            "id": "411200304",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Patchi the Curious",
            "text": "This again? Now isn't the time for seeking shelter. These meteorites may yet present us with an opportunity to get deeper inside the Thousand Winds Temple.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200305"
            ]
          },
          "411200305": {
            "id": "411200305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Deeper inside the temple?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200306"
            ]
          },
          "411200306": {
            "id": "411200306",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "Patchi says that if a meteorite hits the Thousand Winds Temple, we'll be able to follow its path into the temple's inner chambers... or whatever else may be underneath.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200307"
            ]
          },
          "411200307": {
            "id": "411200307",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "But this is wishful thinking. If a meteorite does strike the temple, we wouldn't be able to get away in time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200308"
            ]
          },
          "411200308": {
            "id": "411200308",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "We should really take cover somewhere. And if a meteorite were to hit the Thousand Winds Temple and open a path beyond, couldn't we just come back later and explore it then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200309"
            ]
          },
          "411200309": {
            "id": "411200309",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Patchi the Curious",
            "text": "But what if someone gets there before we do? If you want to go back, go yourself. I'll wait here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200310"
            ]
          },
          "411200310": {
            "id": "411200310",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "But... Alright, then. I'm sorry, Traveler, but I think the two of us will stay here for a while more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200311"
            ]
          },
          "411200311": {
            "id": "411200311",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "Don't worry. If there's any danger, I... I'll settle it myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200312"
            ]
          },
          "411200312": {
            "id": "411200312",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "Oh, that reminds me... There was a person named Schuster who passed this way earlier, looking all shaken up...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200313"
            ]
          },
          "411200313": {
            "id": "411200313",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "He asked me for a sip of water, before saying that he had to get to Mondstadt and hurrying off.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200314"
            ]
          },
          "411200314": {
            "id": "411200314",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "But he wasn't running in the direction of the city at all — he was headed towards Stormbearer Point instead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200315"
            ]
          },
          "411200315": {
            "id": "411200315",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "Perhaps... he might have forgotten the way in his fright.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200316"
            ]
          },
          "411200316": {
            "id": "411200316",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "You should also head that way and look for him near Stormbearer Point. I can't imagine what might happen if he runs into some monsters...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200317"
            ]
          },
          "411200317": {
            "id": "411200317",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Doolan",
            "text": "I'll keep Patchi company here, and if something really does happen... Um, I'll handle things myself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112008",
      "subQuestName": "Look for Terrified Schuster",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411200801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411200801": {
            "id": "411200801",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Terrified Schuster",
            "text": "Agh! Y—You... Oh, you're not a monster...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200802"
            ]
          },
          "411200802": {
            "id": "411200802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Excuse me, please seek shelter within Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200803"
            ]
          },
          "411200803": {
            "id": "411200803",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Terrified Schuster",
            "text": "I—I know that I should! Why, I'm out here notifying people to seek shelter as well. I might have taken a few extra turns, yes, but still—!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200804"
            ]
          },
          "411200804": {
            "id": "411200804",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Alright, so why are you hiding over here, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200805"
            ]
          },
          "411200805": {
            "id": "411200805",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Terrified Schuster",
            "text": "I... I'm resting! Something wrong with that? D—Don't you worry about me! Just head back to Mondstadt... or something.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200806"
            ]
          },
          "411200806": {
            "id": "411200806",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Terrified Schuster",
            "text": "Meteorites and monsters... Does anyone out and about at this time have anything in their braincases at all?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200807"
            ]
          },
          "411200807": {
            "id": "411200807",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, are there any other people out and about right now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200808"
            ]
          },
          "411200808": {
            "id": "411200808",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Terrified Schuster",
            "text": "I was looking for Vind, actually... by which I mean that sister who is always seen around Stormbearer Point.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200809"
            ]
          },
          "411200809": {
            "id": "411200809",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Terrified Schuster",
            "text": "I searched that entire area, but I couldn't find her, so I went somewhere else to try my luck there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200810"
            ]
          },
          "411200810": {
            "id": "411200810",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Terrified Schuster",
            "text": "But I was discovered by a group of crazed monsters instead. Just barely escaped them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200811"
            ]
          },
          "411200811": {
            "id": "411200811",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Terrified Schuster",
            "text": "I twisted and turned this way and that, all the way back to Stormbearer Point — still no sign of Vind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200812"
            ]
          },
          "411200812": {
            "id": "411200812",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Terrified Schuster",
            "text": "I can only hope that sister's already back inside Mondstadt...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200813"
            ]
          },
          "411200813": {
            "id": "411200813",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Terrified Schuster",
            "text": "Alright, I'm heading back to the city. You should go back as well. This is no time to be taking outdoor strolls..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112004",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Vind",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411200401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411200401": {
            "id": "411200401",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Vind",
            "text": "Hmm? What brings you here, Traveler?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200402"
            ]
          },
          "411200402": {
            "id": "411200402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Where have you been?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200403"
            ]
          },
          "411200403": {
            "id": "411200403",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Vind",
            "text": "Oh, I'm sorry. I was walking around, watching the ocean, so I probably wasn't all that easy to find... Is something the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200404"
            ]
          },
          "411200404": {
            "id": "411200404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Could you please return to Mondstadt to seek shelter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200405"
            ]
          },
          "411200405": {
            "id": "411200405",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Vind",
            "text": "Seek shelter? Ah, you're referring to those meteorites. I understand, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200406"
            ]
          },
          "411200406": {
            "id": "411200406",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "W—Watch out! We've got monsters incoming!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112005",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all opponents",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112006",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Vind",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411200601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411200601": {
            "id": "411200601",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Vind",
            "text": "Phew... Thank you, that was quite a close call.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200602"
            ]
          },
          "411200602": {
            "id": "411200602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And that's why I asked you to seek shelter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200603"
            ]
          },
          "411200603": {
            "id": "411200603",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Vind",
            "text": "I'm sorry, but I can't go back right now. These meteorites are strange enough as it stands...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200604"
            ]
          },
          "411200604": {
            "id": "411200604",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Vind",
            "text": "In times like this, it wouldn't be surprising if a storm were to churn the seas again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200605"
            ]
          },
          "411200605": {
            "id": "411200605",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Vind",
            "text": "I must keep watch here. If a storm does occur, I must be able to warn the city immediately.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200606"
            ]
          },
          "411200606": {
            "id": "411200606",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Vind",
            "text": "Thanks for informing me, though. I'll be more careful."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112007",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Grace",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411200701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411200701": {
            "id": "411200701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "You're back. Have you managed to notify all of them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200702"
            ]
          },
          "411200702": {
            "id": "411200702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yes. None of them want to return right now, though...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200703"
            ]
          },
          "411200703": {
            "id": "411200703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "They all refused? One wonders what important tasks they must have, that they should feel compelled to stay in the wilderness at a time like this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200704"
            ]
          },
          "411200704": {
            "id": "411200704",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Guess that's the free people of Mondstadt for you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411200705"
            ]
          },
          "411200705": {
            "id": "411200705",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Grace",
            "text": "Haha, that's true. The people of Mondstadt are as free as the wind, indeed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
